From: liuqin Fedora maintainers <liuqin@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: forward real liuqin connector temperature while powered

Source: liuqin v0.7.0 8511ab11, 79ad9ad2, ac3d75c0 and final ADC fixes
Adaptation: retain 7.3 variants, pen, orientation and request lifetime; omit fake-hot and cooling-level interfaces.

---
